<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Character Details — Untitled</title>
<link href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=satoshi@400,500,600,700,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<style>
body { font-family: "Satoshi", sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #14181C; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.wrap { flex: 1; max-width: 900px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 0 20px; text-align: center; }
.icon-box { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background: #181D22; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 20px; font-size: 28px; color: var(--orange); }
h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #FFFFFF; }
p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto 24px; line-height: 1.6; }
.btn-back { display: inline-block; background: var(--orange); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: var(--r-full, 9999px); font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(255,85,0,0.35); transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.1s; }
.btn-back:hover { background: #E54B00; transform: translateY(-1px); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <main class="wrap">
        <div class="icon-box"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg></div>
        <h1>Character Database</h1>
        <p>Detailed character biographies, voice actor credits, and appearance histories are being curated by our community.</p>
        <a href="/anime" class="btn-back">Browse All Anime →</a>
    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>